                        "form": "винье́тками"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "82d17d73-ad30-4f23-b1f1-ad6a1a61f5e9",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "винье́тке"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "2aac28e2-ead2-45a7-98ba-550d5fb9d0fa",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "винье́тках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3c59c430-6eb1-39e8-ab6d-62647c7ad003",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "полигр. украшение в виде небольшого рисунка в книге, в альбоме, на листке почтовой бумаги и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e808b585-e64d-4b69-aabe-4dd7af5bbfc3",
                                "sense_id": "3c59c430-6eb1-39e8-ab6d-62647c7ad003",
                                "text": "Боря Чернев фотографировался у какого-то предприимчивого фотографа; снимки были в виньетке из звёздочек, с надписью «Память Вены»."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bb635571-50eb-4993-ad34-61fefbdd73a4",
                                "sense_id": "3c59c430-6eb1-39e8-ab6d-62647c7ad003",
                                "text": "Самыми замечательными в книге были картинки ― маленькие виньетки в начале каждой главы."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d0a84d8-a979-4de4-b708-3a71e35763fd",
                                "sense_id": "3c59c430-6eb1-39e8-ab6d-62647c7ad003",
                                "text": "В начале первой исписанной страницы виньетка ― простенький узор из переплетающихся лент, подражающий нарядным заставкам пергаменных книг."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dda1e49-56b9-4610-833e-95bcd24f6708",
                                "sense_id": "3c59c430-6eb1-39e8-ab6d-62647c7ad003",
                                "text": "В соседней комнате в чёрных шкафах стояли старинные книги ― за стёклами были видны их кожаные корешки, украшенные золотыми виньетками."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "108b6e85-feca-3fed-811d-c24dd2844e30",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "филат. центральный элемент почтовой марки, обычно размещающий рисунок"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "89553c89-1694-32e6-bf47-2d29817441fa",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "непочтовая марка, которая схожа с почтовой, но которую нельзя использовать для оплаты почтовой корреспонденции"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5255e1c3-2f73-3e4a-a27f-4f52aaa0adf2",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., филол. короткий, описательный отрывок романа, повести, сценария, поэмы и т. п., который сфокусирован на одном временном моменте или персонаже и даёт ясное и точное представление об этом персонаже, идее, окружении или каком-либо объекте"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58bc00a5-e8b2-4373-b44f-72d5d5541599",
                                "sense_id": "5255e1c3-2f73-3e4a-a27f-4f52aaa0adf2",
                                "text": "Не всякий вспомнившийся эпизод, любопытный исторически, этнографически или автобиографически (и забавный в устном варианте), представляет законный материал для виньетки."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "da9ef5dc-d695-3b53-b28d-5a43ca75f2c1",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен., фотогр., кино фотоснимок или кинокадр с затемнением по краю кадра; также приём обработки (фильтр), имитирующий такой оптический эффект"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a718b7b0-5993-37c7-9431-a65fc1c4089e",
                        "entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "автомоб., : наклейка на лобовое стекло автомобиля, свидетельствующая об уплате дорожного сбора"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "в некоторых странах Европы"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3673c170-bd5f-4306-a0f5-e2e445d5b843",
                        "source_entry_id": "d82f2654-5dd5-3510-bcea-fa14ea26f70b",
                        "target_lang_word": "vignette",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vignette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bd38a09c-2712-3ebe-97d1-8efd29091bff",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A running ornament consisting of leaves and tendrils, used in Gothic architecture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d1093a6-85fb-332e-a04e-d1e896dce6fc",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A decorative design, originally representing vine branches or tendrils, at the head of a chapter, of a manuscript or printed book, or in a similar position."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e40c0b5d-3a63-4385-9b29-9baea3ad3cd3",
                                                "sense_id": "1d1093a6-85fb-332e-a04e-d1e896dce6fc",
                                                "text": "The centrality of this particular trope can been seen in the vignette adorning the opening page of Denis Diderot and Jean le Rond d'Alembert's Encyclopédie, ou dictionnaire raisonnée des sciences, des arts et des métiers (1751–1752)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49ec53f4-ca9d-35aa-abff-584e8288ba14",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any small borderless picture in a book, especially an engraving, photograph, or the like, which vanishes gradually at the edge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08d9bd4d-9da7-3da7-8c69-b3961dc6c54d",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A short story or anecdote that presents a scene or tableau, or paints a picture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d66846a-792c-40bc-b3ee-f2855fde7100",
                                                "sense_id": "08d9bd4d-9da7-3da7-8c69-b3961dc6c54d",
                                                "text": "A particular classroom incident, and the vignette I used to portray it, had a significant impact on the interpretative framework for my research into scientific literacy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15226490-c29e-4cdf-893f-5ba91c7e0e56",
                                                "sense_id": "08d9bd4d-9da7-3da7-8c69-b3961dc6c54d",
                                                "text": "I have two favourite vignettes from the voting lobbies on Wednesday night. The first is the news that one minister told the Tory chief whip, Julian Smith: “You don’t know what you’re doing,” to which Smith replied, “I do know what I’m doing”."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a517b65c-2bc3-362a-97f9-75e153d8426d",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The central pictorial image on a postage stamp."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44530097-50e6-42b7-8ebf-4d2804b84739",
                                                "sense_id": "a517b65c-2bc3-362a-97f9-75e153d8426d",
                                                "text": "At the top of the stamp and centered slightly to the right is the wording, “U. S. Postage,” in white Gothic. Below the vignette are the words, “Little White House,” in quotations, with “Warm Springs,” centered directly below in dark Gothic, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "829097ab-4cbe-383b-b846-22a311a17518",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The characteristic of a camera lens, either by deficiency in design or by mismatch of the lens with the film format, that produces an image smaller than the film's frame with a crudely focused border. Photographers may deliberately choose this characteristic for a special effect."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "05d0821d-d9be-38f4-beed-b3f44d852448",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any effect in a photographic picture where qualities vanish towards the edges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aba1b7e0-21fc-4943-9038-a445a946affb",
                                                "sense_id": "05d0821d-d9be-38f4-beed-b3f44d852448",
                                                "text": "Liz Brent, broker at Go Brent in Maryland and Washington, DC, said she’s spent the past few months changing how she presents properties by emphasizing photographs, 3-D tours, and video vignettes for homes online."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "75e46bd4-f1c9-32ef-90f3-a3a521ca60f2",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hardware deficiency (even occurring in most expensive models) of a computer display wherein the picture slants towards a colour or brightness towards the edges especially if viewed from an angle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "de449aa5-a5a2-37fc-9bea-2a680d61dc2f",
                                        "entry_id": "5e583cea-cfe1-31ea-b8b8-c53b139db882",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A small sticker affixed to a vehicle windscreen to indicate that tolls have been paid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c68dd4d-3885-444f-a162-efc77d29681c",
                                                "sense_id": "de449aa5-a5a2-37fc-9bea-2a680d61dc2f",
                                                "text": "In order to drive on Bulgarian roads outside Sofia you'll need to purchase a vignette which must be displayed in the windscreen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "vignette",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cfef0f0d-ff39-3f98-8016-25b21862f7a5",
                                        "entry_id": "4cedca57-23a1-3aee-893a-306116179122",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make, as an engraving or a photograph, with a border or edge gradually fading away."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63d3f4b9-309a-403e-bfbd-5e47a779a44d",
                                                "sense_id": "cfef0f0d-ff39-3f98-8016-25b21862f7a5",
                                                "text": "Long minutes afterwards the sun disclosed itself, high above the earth's rim, over a vignetted bank of edgeless mist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfec2952-29f2-4adf-ada9-c26bc301cb72",
                                                "sense_id": "cfef0f0d-ff39-3f98-8016-25b21862f7a5",
                                                "text": "Along the wainscot lie heaps of bolsters and quilts, covered with old-fashioned chintzes. Before the War these chintzes were specially made in Russia for the Central Asian market: one bolster depicts steamships, early motor-cars, and the first aeroplane, vignetted in circles of flowers on a vermilion background."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
